{"sym":"BEP","v":2,"about":{"summary":"Brookfield Renewable Partners L.P. owns a portfolio of renewable power generating facilities in the North America, Colombia, and Brazil. The company generates electricity through hydroelectric, wind, solar, distributed generation, and pumped storage; and offers sustainable solutions, such as renewable natural gas, carbon capture and storage, recycling, cogeneration, biomass, nuclear services, eFuels, and power transformation. It operates as the general partner of Brookfield Renewable Partners L.P. The company was formerly known as Brookfield Renewable Energy Partners L.P. and changed its name to Brookfield Renewable Partners L.P. in May 2016. The company was founded in 1999 and is based in Toronto, Canada.","lead":"Brookfield Renewable Partners L.P. owns a portfolio of renewable power generating facilities in the North America, Colombia, and Brazil.","web":"https://www.bep.brookfield.com","emp":5870,"city":"Toronto","state":"ON","country":"Canada"},"officers":[{"n":"Mr. Connor David Teskey","t":"Chief Executive Officer","age":38,"yb":1987,"pay":2174100,"fy":2025},{"n":"Ms. Jennifer Mazin L.L.B.","t":"Co-President and General Counsel","age":51,"yb":1974,"pay":1973500,"fy":2025},{"n":"Mr. Wyatt Hartley CPA","t":"Co-President","age":44,"yb":1981,"pay":996630,"fy":2025},{"n":"Mr. Patrick Taylor","t":"Chief Financial Officer","age":39,"yb":1986,"pay":817600,"fy":2025},{"n":"Ms. Natalie Johanna Adomait","t":"Chief Operating Officer","age":35,"yb":1990,"pay":1572000,"fy":2025},{"n":"Mr. Ralf Niklas Rank","t":"Managing Partner of Private Equity, Europe, CIO Services","age":48,"yb":1977,"pay":1119000,"fy":2025},{"n":"Mr. Benjamin Michael Vaughan","t":"Senior Managing Partner","age":53,"yb":1972,"pay":480570,"fy":2025},{"n":"Mr. Brian Cook","t":"Managing Director of Renewable Power & Transition","fy":2025},{"n":"Mr. Luiz Ildefonso Simões Lopes","t":"Executive Chairman of Latin America","age":74,"yb":1951,"fy":2025},{"n":"Mr. Justin B. Be